G1(X, q) = q^4 + (-4*X^2 - 4*X)*q^3 - 2*X^2*q^2 + (-4*X^3 - 4*X^2)*q + X^4
G2(X, q) = q^4 + (4*X^2 + 4*X)*q^3 - 2*X^2*q^2 + (4*X^3 + 4*X^2)*q + X^4
G2(X, q) - G1(X, -q) = 0 (should be 0)

factor(G1) over Q[q, X]: Mat([q^4 + (-4*X^2 - 4*X)*q^3 - 2*X^2*q^2 + (-4*X^3 - 4*X^2)*q + X^4, 1])
factor(G2) over Q[q, X]: Mat([q^4 + (4*X^2 + 4*X)*q^3 - 2*X^2*q^2 + (4*X^3 + 4*X^2)*q + X^4, 1])

Both irreducible in Q[q, X] => irreducible in Q(q)[X] by Gauss.
